1
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:13,740
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,400
Your moves!

3
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,680
Oh, we're back.

4
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,320
Then I guess it's over.

5
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:20,091
The tablet returned us all to the present.

6
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,160
Let's hope so.

7
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:23,737
Are you worried about the Pharaoh?

8
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:24,880
I mean, a temp?

9
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:28,477
Yeah, you don't think he's still
stuck in the ancient past, do you?

10
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,913
Pharaoh, are you there?

11
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:41,117
i'm right where i belong with us you
did it we all did it together and now

12
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:46,297
the darkness unleashed by the shadow
game so long ago is finally over it

13
00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:51,177
only took you five thousand years and
i'm glad i was here to help me too

14
00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:55,597
i mean a guy can get pretty used to
this whole saving the world thing Now,

15
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:59,057
remind me how getting possessed
by an evil spirit was helping.

16
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:01,493
I have no further comments at this time.

17
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:05,257
Embarrassed because you nearly
destroyed the world as we know it?

18
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:08,377
Oh, like you've never gotten
possessed before, Joey.

19
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:10,225
I'm really going to miss them.

20
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,720
Farrah, uh, I mean, a town.

21
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:17,137
I promise one of these days I'll
get used to that name of yours.

22
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:20,937
It's hard to believe after all these
years you have your memory back.

23
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:21,957
Thanks to you.

24
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:25,657
You've chained Yugi to an anchor and
threatened to take over the world.

25
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:26,717
Ringing any bells?

26
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,517
I have no further comments at this time.

27
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,718
Pharaoh, tell Joey he was possessed.

28
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:37,480
Hey, Yugi.

29
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,741
I believe you'll be needing that.

30
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,620
The Millennium Eye?

31
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,880
And where did you get your
hands on that, rich boy?

32
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,830
Kaiba?

33
00:02:49,913 --> 00:02:53,245
You don't just chuck a Millennium
item at someone and walk away.

34
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:56,249
I'm sick of your silent
treatment routines.

35
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,070
Hey!

36
00:03:02,153 --> 00:03:02,983
It's you!

37
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:05,730
Hello.

38
00:03:05,813 --> 00:03:06,643
Where are we?

39
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:08,060
Wait a second, guys.

40
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,517
I have a hunch this is the good Bacora.

41
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:12,380
Now, let me see.

42
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:16,700
The last thing I remember was
hearing a strange voice and then...

43
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:21,180
Whoa, take it easy, pal. What's wrong?

44
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:23,200
I need some food.

45
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:24,780
So do I.

46
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:26,417
You don't see me passing out.

47
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:27,330
Joey!

48
00:03:27,413 --> 00:03:28,857
Look, we could all use a bite.

49
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,740
It has been 5,000 years.

50
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:37,778
I think he's got something
that belongs to you, Yook.

51
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:39,010
Right.

52
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:44,046
Now that Zork has vanished, so
has the evil spirit of the ring.

53
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:46,340
So Bakura is finally free.

54
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:50,520
Hey, guys, a little help here?

55
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:53,910
Thanks, Taya.

56
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,216
Grab a leg, will ya?

57
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:05,385
Shadi, please know that your items
will finally be laid to rest.

58
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,340
And thank you, my friend.

59
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,877
Seto, according to the
inscription on this tablet,

60
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:19,200
you went on to be a great
pharaoh in your own right.

61
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:23,880
You kept my father's dream alive
by maintaining peace in Egypt.

62
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:28,560
And knowing this, my spirit can
finally enter its resting place.

63
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:30,766
Wait, so what are you saying?

64
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:33,420
I think you know, Yugi.

65
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:41,300
My pharaoh, were you able to
recover your lost memories? Yes.

66
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:47,200
Then after 5,000 years, our family's
task is finally complete. You're right.

67
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:51,580
And the seven Millennium items are
gathered together at last. My king.

68
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:52,950
I know.

69
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:57,080
Now I must seal them away forever
so I can enter the spirit world.

70
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:58,420
You're leaving us?

71
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,280
This is the final task
of my mission, Taya.

72
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:05,260
I guess I always knew. I mean,

73
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:07,457
you came back after all these years so you

74
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:10,246
could regain your memories
and save the world.

75
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:13,560
And now that you've done
that, you can finally rest.

76
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:19,477
Pharaoh, if you and your
friends would like us to,

77
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:24,057
Merrick and I can lead you to the final
resting place of the seven Millennium Items.

78
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:25,905
You mean the Millennium Stone?

79
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:31,447
And the inscription above this
ancient stone reads as follows.

80
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:38,660
To the spirit world thou may proceed,
but first thou must complete this deed.

81
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:43,520
Return the items whence they came,
and speak aloud the pharaoh's name.

82
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,780
Are you ready for your final task? Yes.

83
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:53,906
Then allow me to be your guide
to the shrine of the next world.

84
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,885
Couldn't we zip over to
this shrine in a plane?

85
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:15,537
I'm afraid this sanctuary can only
be reached by boat We don't want

86
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:19,057
to rush this This is the last trip
we'll ever take with the pharaoh,

87
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,280
dude Since when are you so sappy?

88
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:27,860
Boats rule! I love boats!

89
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:29,057
Who doesn't love boats?

90
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,199
That's the spirit?

91
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,180
Ages ago,

92
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,477
it was believed that boats
were the only vessels

93
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:38,360
able to transport spirits
to the world beyond.

94
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:40,000
The world beyond?

95
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:44,833
The ancient Egyptians believed that
this spirit world existed in the west,

96
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:46,138
where the sun sets.

97
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:50,697
and so the pharaoh's court ordered this

98
00:06:50,780 --> 00:06:53,820
sanctuary to be built on
an island west of egypt

99
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:59,180
ahoy there mateys all right
you landlubbers climb aboard

100
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:06,320
no way where did you guys come
from about time you got here

101
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,550
hey

102
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:13,317
we've been bored out of
our minds waiting for

103
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:16,237
you guys to get here i
didn't know you were coming

104
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:18,177
Well, ever since you left for Egypt,

105
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,157
there was this voice
inside my head saying,

106
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:24,457
How can you miss such a momentous event
in your grandson's life, you old fool?

107
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:28,277
And with Gramps hearing voices in his
head, I thought I should come along, too.

108
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,125
Just to keep an eye on things.

109
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:33,714
And when we got here, we ran
into Mokuba at the airport.

110
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:39,060
Yeah, you took off without telling anyone,
so Roland and I tracked you down. I see.

111
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:43,455
I didn't know I needed to report every
move I make to my little brother.

112
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,797
Well, you better not do it again,

113
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:49,056
or I'll take over Kaiba Corp
and make you work for me.

114
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:51,512
Tell me the truth, Duke.

115
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:54,357
Did you really come all this
way just to keep Gramps company?

116
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:58,060
Well, it's not like anyone
invited me, so I invited myself.

117
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:01,657
After everything we've been through, it
would have been nice to get a phone call.

118
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:03,717
Sorry, Duke, but I had a lot going on.

119
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:07,017
Your grandfather filled me in on
the flight over, so I understand.

120
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:09,747
And while we were waiting
for you to show up,

121
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:14,311
I took the liberty of explaining things
to everyone else you forgot to call.

122
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:17,120
You've finally done it, Yu-Gi-Boy.

123
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:21,645
Everything I spent my life creating
has been leading up to this.

124
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:25,277
From the moment I received
the Millennium Eye...

125
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:31,160
...to the moment I recreated the ancient
Shadow Games in the form of Duel Monsters.

126
00:08:33,580 --> 00:08:39,140
it was fate's hand guiding me to set the
stage for the pharaoh's final journey home

127
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:44,297
but i wasn't the only
one led by fate every

128
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:46,777
person the pharaoh
encountered along the way was

129
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:50,397
destined to play a role
in his journey and i'm

130
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:53,260
willing to bet most of
them didn't even know it

131
00:08:58,140 --> 00:08:59,780
But each individual,

132
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:03,457
no matter how utterly
clueless Was a necessary piece

133
00:09:03,540 --> 00:09:06,540
needed to complete the
puzzle of the pharaoh's life

134
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:14,160
Be they weird fishermen duelists
Or annoying mousy little girls

135
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:19,857
All of these people have one thing
in common Each one is connected

136
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:25,220
by a young man named Yugi Boy and
that mysterious alter ego of his.

137
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:29,340
And not only did these
individuals help Yugi,

138
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:33,820
but in turn, Yugi touched
each of their lives as well.

139
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:41,517
I know I've said it a million times,
but thanks for being there, guys.

140
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,430
Of course.

141
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:43,980
Enough already.

142
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:47,397
What are you still hanging
around for anyway, rich boy?

143
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,700
We have our reasons.

144
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:50,688
What are our reasons again?

145
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:53,960
Yeah, why did you come?

146
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:59,120
Although he'd never admit it, Kaiba is
here for the same reason we're all here.

147
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:02,560
To witness the Pharaoh's
final rite of passage.

148
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,520
So he does believe.

149
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:08,040
Yuki, before we go any further,

150
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:11,317
there's something else you
should know about all this.

151
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:15,459
There's another ancient passage
inscribed above the Millennium Stone.

152
00:10:15,660 --> 00:10:17,307
It mentions a battle ritual.

153
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:19,280
Did you say battle?

154
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,857
In order for the Pharaoh
to enter the spirit world,

155
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:26,940
he must first face off against a
worthy opponent in battle and lose.

156
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:29,202
What kind of battle do you mean?

157
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:32,317
In ancient times, this
referred to a duel with swords.

158
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:36,440
But luckily for us, today we duel
one another with cards. A duel?

159
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:38,540
Exactly, Yugi.

160
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:41,074
I must lose in a game of duel monsters.

161
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:43,921
I don't mean to be disrespectful,

162
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:47,277
Merrick, but I don't get what the
challenge is in losing a duel.

163
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,740
Think about it, guys.

164
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:51,137
Winning is easy for the Pharaoh,

165
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:53,257
but being able to accept
defeat is probably

166
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:55,917
the greatest test of
his character there is.

167
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,941
You may have a point there, Duke.

168
00:10:58,220 --> 00:11:02,867
But where are we going to find a duelist
who's good enough to beat the Pharaoh?

169
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:15,377
You know, this boat ride
really takes me back, Uke.

170
00:11:15,460 --> 00:11:18,797
Doesn't it seem like just yesterday
we were all on a boat like this,

171
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,468
headed for Duelist Kingdom?

172
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:21,990
Yeah.

173
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:26,008
Not to toot my own horn, but
I've come a long way since then.

174
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:29,817
And if given the chance, I could
kick the pharaoh's ancient butt.

175
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:30,730
Huh?

176
00:11:30,813 --> 00:11:31,643
Huh?

177
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,797
Alright, so maybe I came
on a little strong there.

178
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,880
A little strong?

179
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:39,720
Now, I meant to say, I'd like
a shot against the pharaoh.

180
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:42,020
It's too risky. You'll lose.

181
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,190
There's no chance.

182
00:11:43,273 --> 00:11:46,997
Thanks for the support, but someone's
got to beat the pharaohs, so why not me?

183
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,904
Because you're a joke, Wheeler.

184
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,599
You talking to me?

185
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:55,019
Don't you losers realize I've been
waiting for this moment for years?

186
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,620
I challenge you to the ultimate duel!

187
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,480
You sure about this?

188
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:01,340
Now wait a second here!

189
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,460
I was in line first!

190
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:05,680
Hey! Hey!

191
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:07,960
I'm gonna make this brief.

192
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:12,257
I don't believe in all this ancient
Egyptian nonsense, and I never did.

193
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:14,880
But I deserve a shot against you.

194
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,435
You mean the Pharaoh?

195
00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:18,560
It does make sense.

196
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,230
After all,

197
00:12:20,313 --> 00:12:24,672
you guys have had a rivalry going on
ever since he showed up in this world.

198
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:26,460
Then let's do this.

199
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,200
Actually, no.

200
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:30,640
I've already made my choice.

201
00:12:30,900 --> 00:12:33,260
I'm gonna duel the Pharaoh. You what?

202
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,200
I don't think you can.

203
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:36,717
Don't you see, guys?

204
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,976
This duel will be a test for me, too.

205
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,400
How do I put this?

206
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,177
You can't play a duel
against yourself, Yug.

207
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:46,560
I don't plan to.

208
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,030
That's it.

209
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:50,357
I'm not going to stand here and watch you

210
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,969
give a title shot to
your imaginary friend.

211
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,360
Drop him, rich boy.

212
00:12:54,740 --> 00:12:57,564
Trust me, this is something
I know I need to do.

213
00:12:57,660 --> 00:12:59,840
And deep down, you know it too.

214
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:04,730
Yug.

215
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:06,330
Mokuba.

216
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:10,557
All right, Yugye.

217
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:13,157
I don't know what kind
of stunt you're pulling,

218
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:16,937
but if you're going to be dueling, then
you may as well build yourself a real deck.

219
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:19,500
Not that bargain basement deck you use.

220
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:23,189
Wow, that's a pretty
impressive collection.

221
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:26,220
But I won't be needing it, Kaiba. No way.

222
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:28,618
I'll be sticking with my usual deck.

223
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:33,017
The Pharaoh and I built it together, so
it's only fitting that I use that one.

224
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:33,930
Makes sense.

225
00:13:34,013 --> 00:13:35,076
If you want to lose.

226
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,680
What a waste of time.

227
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,760
Seto! Wait!

228
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,300
Enjoy the cruise.

229
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:47,830
Come in.

230
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:49,960
Hey, Yugi. Have a sec?

231
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:51,690
Sure, Taya.

232
00:13:51,773 --> 00:13:53,020
So, what's up?

233
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:57,677
As the self-appointed cruise director, I
thought I'd tell you we arrived tomorrow.

234
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:58,620
Cool. Thanks.

235
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:04,475
I guess you're getting ready for your
big duel against the Pharaoh, huh?

236
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:05,990
Yeah.

237
00:14:06,073 --> 00:14:08,697
It's sort of like my final gift to
him before he leaves us forever.

238
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,460
I get it.

239
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:15,345
I guess I don't want to
see him go, that's all.

240
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:19,738
Neither do I, but it's time
for him to move on, Tata.

241
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:23,922
Besides, if I win, that means I'm
ready to separate from him, too.

242
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:27,020
Oh. Yugi's right.

243
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:30,560
But it doesn't make this
any easier. You okay?

244
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,560
Oh, yeah, everything's great!

245
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:36,477
I should really let you get
back to doing your thing now.

246
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:40,220
All right, so, great, then
I'll see you tomorrow.

247
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:41,800
Good night, Teya.

248
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:47,540
Pharaoh, I have a feeling she
wanted to say goodbye to you.

249
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:49,630
Sorry.

250
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,729
I know this is what's
best for the Pharaoh.

251
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:58,440
He doesn't belong in this world,
and now that he has his memory back,

252
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:00,140
he can finally be free.

253
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:05,380
But secretly, I keep hoping Yugi's
gonna lose, so the Pharaoh has to stay.

254
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:13,852
Before I solved the Millennium Puzzle,
I was a completely different person.

255
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,620
Timid, shy, lonely.

256
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:27,925
But ever since that day, when the
Pharaoh and I joined together,

257
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,904
I've been strong and confident.

258
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:32,780
And if I win that duel tomorrow,

259
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:36,316
I'll prove that I'm ready
to face the world on my own.

260
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:41,325
All I have to do is remember everything
the Pharaoh taught me, and I can do this!

261
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:48,240
There he is.

262
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:51,777
Dude, we've been looking all over for you.

263
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:53,677
Don't tell me you're
still down in the dumps

264
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:56,217
about not getting to
duel against the Pharaoh.

265
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:57,520
Just let go, man.

266
00:15:59,080 --> 00:15:59,910
You know,

267
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,257
being on this boat has made me do a lot of

268
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:04,987
thinking about the last
few years of my life.

269
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:08,593
Let me tell you, a lot's
changed since I met the pharaoh.

270
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,457
He taught me that even when
the odds are against you,

271
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:14,877
