never give up no matter what.

272
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:18,019
But there's someone whose
life he changed even more.

273
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:20,397
Yeah, Yugi's.

274
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:23,417
And that's why Yugi needs
to be the one to duel him.

275
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:26,360
To see if he's finally
ready to be on his own.

276
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:29,227
You know, you're a lot
smarter than you look.

277
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:31,086
What's that supposed to mean?

278
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:35,497
so let's say this pharaoh does exist and

279
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:37,697
he's the reason yugi's
been winning duels all

280
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:40,497
these years then how on earth is a twerp

281
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:43,227
like yugi gonna defeat
the true king of games

282
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:02,464
That was harder than I thought.

283
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:08,160
Is it safe to come out now?

284
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,877
Have you chosen your cards?

285
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,372
Yup, my deck's complete.

286
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:14,957
Wait, so is that why I haven't heard
from you in the past few hours?

287
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:15,870
Yes.

288
00:17:15,953 --> 00:17:19,859
I traveled to a distant corner of
your mind to give you some privacy.

289
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:21,640
It's only fair.

290
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:25,019
The cards in my opponent's
deck should be a mystery.

291
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:31,440
And just so you know, I don't plan on
going easy on you in tomorrow's duel. Good.

292
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:36,340
Plus, I've gotten to know your
strategies pretty well. Hey,

293
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:39,837
when you share a mind with
someone for as long as we have,

294
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:43,685
you tend to learn a thing or two
about how the other one thinks.

295
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:47,577
Well, I guess it's time
for you to pick your deck.

296
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:50,013
And don't worry, I promise I won't peek.

297
00:17:58,340 --> 00:18:03,057
this is by far the toughest duel of my
life not just because the pharaoh is

298
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:08,300
such a great duelist but because winning
this duel means losing my closest friend

299
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:17,340
i feel as though every opponent i've ever
faced was preparing me for this moment

300
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:20,677
the moment that will decide the fate of my

301
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:25,297
spirit if i win i remain
here sealed within

302
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:28,577
the millennium puzzle but if i lose i'm

303
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:31,400
free to enter the spirit
world where i belong

304
00:18:32,140 --> 00:18:37,077
within that box lies yuki's deck chosen
from a collection that we created

305
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:44,120
together but built completely on his
own and now it is my turn to do the same

306
00:18:55,260 --> 00:19:01,337
it is now complete i have succeeded
in building my strongest deck ever

307
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:07,880
and now the time has come to put it
to the test yugi it's time to duel

308
00:19:21,120 --> 00:19:23,179
Look who decided to roll out of bed

309
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:26,560
Good luck

310
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:29,820
I say we get this duel on the road

311
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:31,190
Let's go

312
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:40,890
Go!
